WEBVTT

00:05:29.982 --> 00:05:33.438
They have strange names:

00:05:33.438 --> 00:05:36.808
UCLG,

00:05:36.808 --> 00:05:41.434
United Cities and Local Governments;

00:05:41.434 --> 00:05:43.234
ICLEI,

00:05:43.234 --> 00:05:48.750
the International Council for Local Environmental Issues.

00:05:48.750 --> 00:05:49.960
And the list goes on:

00:05:49.960 --> 00:05:53.507
Citynet in Asia; City Protocol, a new organization

00:05:53.507 --> 00:05:56.992
out of Barcelona that is using the web

00:05:56.992 --> 00:06:00.069
to share best practices among countries.